(1000012, 1, 1, 1, 'Property for sale in Abu Dhabi', 'Abu Dhabi is one of the most sought-after addresses in Abu Dhabi. Browse verified listings from licensed agencies, with full specifications, floor plans and direct agent contact.', '<h2>About Abu Dhabi</h2><p>Abu Dhabi combines established infrastructure with the kind of scarcity that supports long-term value. Stock ranges from apartments through to villas, and the community is served by international schools, retail and direct road links.</p><h2>What to expect on price</h2><p>Pricing varies considerably by sub-community, aspect and completion status. Use the filters to narrow by bedrooms, size and budget.</p>', '[{"question":"Is Abu Dhabi freehold?","answer":"Most of Abu Dhabi is freehold and available to all nationalities."},{"question":"What are typical service charges?","answer":"Service charges vary by building; each listing states the figure where the agent has supplied it."}]', '["Verified listings only","Direct agent contact","Floor plans available"]', 'https://cdn.livfinder.com/locations/abu-dhabi.jpg', 'Property for Sale in Abu Dhabi, Abu Dhabi | Liv Finder', 'Browse verified property for sale in Abu Dhabi, Abu Dhabi. Villas, apartments and penthouses from licensed agencies.', 1, 'published', '2025-12-23 09:00:00'),
